<title>UK: Deutsche sets warrants on lire/mark.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets warrants on lire/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital markets (Deutsche) has issued three million American-style call and put warrants, in three equal tranches, on the lire and mark, lead manager Deutsche bank said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   18.OCT.96	   LISTING	FRFT, DUSS</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  ITL/DEM - 1.0057</p>
<p>+ + + + + +</p>
<p> WARRANT   EXPIRY     STRIKE    ISSUE     GEARING    PREMIUM</p>
<p> PUT	 15.SEP.97  0.98 DEM  2.96 DEM  33.97 X    5.50 PCT</p>
<p> CALL	16.MAR.98  1.00 DEM  1.77 DEM  56.81 X    1.19 PCT</p>
<p> CALL	16.MAR.98  1.05 DEM  0.50 DEM  201.14 X   4.90 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
